7
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:22,488
software engineering, leadership,
cloud modernization, and

8
00:00:22,531 --> 00:00:23,795
payment processing systems.

9
00:00:24,933 --> 00:00:29,119
Today, I'll be speaking about
feature flags as migration engine,

10
00:00:30,061 --> 00:00:34,390
de-risking domain-driven development
of monolithic payment platforms.

11
00:00:36,379 --> 00:00:37,782
let me start with a question.

12
00:00:38,727 --> 00:00:42,998
How do you modernize a payment
platform when the business cannot

13
00:00:43,039 --> 00:00:46,544
